{"title": "Orc", "pageid": 32969, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Orc", "categories": ["Races"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Half-orc\">Half-orc</a>        </div>\n<p><b>Orcs</b> are a race of <a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">humanoids</a> that are not present but mentioned in <i>Baldur's Gate 3</i>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Orcs are known for their poor temperaments and tendencies toward anger. The offspring of a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> and an orc is known as a <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Half-orc\">half-orc</a>.\n</p><p>They have a tense relationship with <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf#Shield_dwarves\" title=\"Dwarf\">shield dwarves</a>, having warred against them and taken many of their ancient kingdoms.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Approachable_East,_Vol._6\" title=\"The Approachable East, Vol. 6\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Approachable_East,_Vol._6\" title=\"The Approachable East, Vol. 6\">The Approachable East, Vol. 6</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orcs_of_the_Trielta_Hills\" title=\"Orcs of the Trielta Hills\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orcs_of_the_Trielta_Hills\" title=\"Orcs of the Trielta Hills\">Orcs of the Trielta Hills</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Orc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orc\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://fo